{"id": "sllama0001", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The largest bird of prey in the world is the golden e agle. These birds are really impressive, with powerful wings and sharp talons that let them hunt big animals like deer or rabbits. They can grow up to three feet long from head to tail and have a wingspan of over seven feet. Their size and strength make them top predator s in their habitat s across North America, Europe, and Asia.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0009", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The role of Indiana Jones was played by Harrison Ford in the original film series.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
